   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L&#xe4;nsstyrelsesamv. 2002</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L&#xe4;nsstyrelsesamverkan med de baltiska l&#xe4;nderna. Projektm&#xe5;len &#xe4;r att assistera l&#xe4;nderna genom kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring och erfarenhetsutbyte. Det&#xf6;vergripande projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka kompetens och kapacitet inom lokal och regional administration.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish County Administration Boards in cooperation with their counterparts in the Baltic States. The aim of the cooperation is transfer of knowledge and exchange of experience. The overall project aim is to increase the competence and capability within the local and regional administrations.</narrative>
  </description>
